 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"梨花著雨晚来晴。","body":41},{"id":"song:11255","title":"江神子・江城子","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"宝钗飞凤鬓惊鸾。","body":41},{"id":"song:11256","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"著意寻春懒便回。","body":41},{"id":"song:11257","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"水底明霞十顷光。","body":41},{"id":"song:11258","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"漠漠轻□拨不开。","body":41},{"id":"song:11259","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"有甚闲愁可皱眉。","body":41},{"id":"song:11260","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"山上飞泉万斛珠。","body":41},{"id":"song:11261","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"莫避春阴上马迟。","body":41},{"id":"song:11262","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"白苎新袍入嫩凉。","body":41},{"id":"song:11263","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"宋 · 辛弃疾","collection":"宋词","notice":"","excerpt":"莫上扁舟向剡溪。","body":{"start":11263,"hash":"ebaf2b700cd790676a1c7a576e554db41687f7fd2b97492cb2142ea72244c6c4"}}]